    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18088" root="زمت" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمِيتٌ</span></b>  <i>Grave, staid, steady, sedate,</i> or <i>calm,</i>
(IAar, S, A, K, TA,) <i>in his sitting-place:</i> (IAar,
TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُمَتَآءُ</span>, (A,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زمت</span> [app. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُمْتٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُمُتٌ</span>,
if not a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُمَتَآءُ</span>, which I rather
think it to be]. (TA.)

